/T (A key implementation detail is that the supplied program currently simulates the soil value in software rather than reading the potentiometer on GPIO 34 with an analog input function. The Wokwi circuit nevertheless includes the potentiometer and connects its signal to GPIO 34. This report therefore describes the present implementation accurately and identifies physical sensor integration as future work.)
/E (A key implementation detail is that the supplied program currently simulates the soil value in software rather than reading the potentiometer on GPIO 34 with an analog input function. The Wokwi circuit nevertheless includes the potentiometer and connects its signal to GPIO 34. This report therefore describes the present implementation accurately and identifies physical sensor integration as future work.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
