123 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 63 0 R
/T (During this project, I worked on a Smart Irrigation System using an ESP32 and Wokwi simulation. The main idea was to automate irrigation decisions using a soil-condition value, display the status on an OLED and control an irrigation output through a relay.)
/E (During this project, I worked on a Smart Irrigation System using an ESP32 and Wokwi simulation. The main idea was to automate irrigation decisions using a soil-condition value, display the status on an OLED and control an irrigation output through a relay.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 63 0 R
/T (The project work involved understanding the circuit, preparing the ESP32 program, interfacing the OLED through I2C, implementing threshold logic, observing serial output, testing dry and wet conditions and documenting the result. The Wokwi environment made it possible to repeat the tests safely without using a physical pump.)
/E (The project work involved understanding the circuit, preparing the ESP32 program, interfacing the OLED through I2C, implementing threshold logic, observing serial output, testing dry and wet conditions and documenting the result. The Wokwi environment made it possible to repeat the tests safely without using a physical pump.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
125 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 63 0 R
/T (This internship also helped me understand the importance of designing for practical constraints. Because the current project is a simulation and the soil value is generated in software, real sensor accuracy, pump performance, power consumption and field durability could not be measured. These limitations are documented instead of being presented as completed hardware tests.)
/E (This internship also helped me understand the importance of designing for practical constraints. Because the current project is a simulation and the soil value is generated in software, real sensor accuracy, pump performance, power consumption and field durability could not be measured. These limitations are documented instead of being presented as completed hardware tests.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
