/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 63 0 R
/T (Smart irrigation is an application area where embedded systems can be used to make watering decisions more responsive to soil conditions. A simple controller can monitor a condition, compare it with a predefined limit and operate an actuator only when required. The project demonstrates this basic control loop using ESP32, a relay and an OLED display.)
/E (Smart irrigation is an application area where embedded systems can be used to make watering decisions more responsive to soil conditions. A simple controller can monitor a condition, compare it with a predefined limit and operate an actuator only when required. The project demonstrates this basic control loop using ESP32, a relay and an OLED display.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
