/T (Working with Wokwi improved my ability to build and inspect a circuit before moving to physical hardware. The project also showed me why the software implementation and circuit diagram must be checked together: the current diagram includes a potentiometer on GPIO 34, while the supplied code simulates the value instead of reading that pin.)
/E (Working with Wokwi improved my ability to build and inspect a circuit before moving to physical hardware. The project also showed me why the software implementation and circuit diagram must be checked together: the current diagram includes a potentiometer on GPIO 34, while the supplied code simulates the value instead of reading that pin.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
