/Title (Message to juniors and peers: Start with a small working system, test every block separately and document what you actually implemented. Clear documentation is as important as the code when)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 613 0 R
/Prev 693 0 R
/Next 659 0 R
>>
endobj
686 0 obj
<<
/Title (Smart irrigation is an application area where embedded systems can be used to make watering decisions more responsive to soil conditions. A simple controller can monitor a condition, compare it with a predefined limit and operate an actuator only when required. The project demonstrates this basic control loop using ESP32, a relay and an OLED display.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 660 0 R
/Next 694 0 R
>>
