<<
/Title (Current project scope: The Wokwi circuit contains a potentiometer connected to ESP32 GPIO 34 as the simulated soil input, but the supplied program does not currently read GPIO 34. Instead, it automatically changes the variable soilValue between wet and dry ranges. Therefore, the present submission demonstrates the control logic and simulation rather than a calibrated physical soil-moisture measurement.)
